  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PaCCS Large Grants - &apos;Seeing&apos; conflicts at the margins: understanding community experiences through social research and digital narrative in Kenya and Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Large grants using participatory visual and audio methods to explore roles of communities in conflicts, in areas with new resource investments and histories of conflict and violence. Benefits local groups, researchers in Kenya, Madagascar. SDGs:11,16,17</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
